  "reason": "R6 explicitly identifies SRO as a variable worth investigating in a refractory HEA, while R5, R8, R15, R17, and R20 establish that ordered B2/L21-like phases or precipitates can form in HEAs and affect their properties. R7 supplies the exact HfNbTaTiZr system, but addresses interstitials rather than chemical ordering. Together these records could motivate studying ordering in HfNbTaTiZr, but they do not disclose Monte Carlo generation of HfTi/TiZr SRO clusters, percolating ordered pathways, reduced lattice-distortion scattering, phonon-density-of-states changes, or an increase in lattice thermal conductivity. Reconstructing the specific intervention and thermal-transport mechanism would therefore require a substantial new idea."
